OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry albeit
OL,6,Fcloudy night for most, although some
OL,7,Flight rain possible at first for
OL,8,Fnorthern parts. Skies gradually clear
OL,9,Fin the south, where some patches of
OL,10,Ffog may develop. Feeling cold,
OL,11,Fparticularly under clear spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAny areas of fog will lift
OL,14,Fthrough the morning. From then, a dry
OL,15,Fbut cloudy day is expected, with the
OL,16,Foccasional break to brighter skies.
OL,17,FAnother chilly autumn day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
