OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFoggy
OL,6,Fand frosty mornings for Sunday and
OL,7,FMonday, then becoming crisp autumn
OL,8,Fdays with long spells of sunshine.
OL,9,FFine to start Tuesday then turning
OL,10,Fmilder, wetter and windier by
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
